VALUES ('Men in Childcare Hit Creche Barrier', 'men-in-childcare-hit-creche-barrier', '<p>As a companion to the latest edition&#8217;s feature on the lack of <a href="https://changingireland.blogspot.com/2011/12/other-1.html#more" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">men in childcare</a>, Changing Ireland commissioned this cartoon.</p>
<p>Enjoy!</p>
<div><a href="https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-i51FNP8ZFIw/TtzzQwLvubI/AAAAAAAAAWM/G-uIgmSYEjE/s1600/In+Childcare+%2528by+JCA%2529+Superhero+status.jpg"><img decoding="async" border="0" src="https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-i51FNP8ZFIw/TtzzQwLvubI/AAAAAAAAAWM/G-uIgmSYEjE/s1600/In+Childcare+%2528by+JCA%2529+Superhero+status.jpg" /></a></div>
<div></div>
<div></div>', 'As a companion to the latest edition’s feature on the lack of men in childcare, Changing Ireland commissioned this cartoon. Enjoy!', '', '', '[{"slug":"uncategorized","title":"Uncategorized"}]', '[]', '', 244, 1, '2011-12-05T16:38:00Z', '2019-09-13T10:48:28Z', '2011-12-05T16:38:00Z')
